# Punch Up reference

`Punch Up (reference)` (`D:/WEB_BTC_PunchUp`) is a separate project used only as a reference for BTC Craps.

- Read it to copy patterns into BTC Craps.
- Never create, edit, delete, or format files in that folder.
- Never commit, stage, or modify git state in that repository.
- New craps code belongs in the BTC Craps root.
